<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>财富|财富</title><link>https://fortune.com</link><description>财富 500 强日报和突发商业新闻</description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 12:15:29 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在雇主将更多医疗费用转嫁给工人之前，他们应该问医院一个问题</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/employers-shift-healthcare-costs-workers-harvard-health/</link><description>医疗保健是一项不断增长的运营支出，根据美世的数据，大约四分之三的首席财务官将医疗保健列为运营成本关注的前五名。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2161459477-e1786652392311.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/employers-shift-healthcare-costs-workers-harvard-health/</guid></item><item><title>诺贝尔奖获得者达伦·阿西莫格鲁表示，人工智能和自由民主面临着同样的危机：“有一种使一切升级的趋势”</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/nobel-laureate-daron-acemoglu-liberal-democracy-book-stupid-ai-debate/</link><description>这位麻省理工学院的经济学家告诉《财富》杂志：“同时在头脑中存有两个明显相互冲突的想法已经变得有点激进了。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/profile-image-61349.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/nobel-laureate-daron-acemoglu-liberal-democracy-book-stupid-ai-debate/</guid></item><item><title>“伟大的量子迁移”即将到来，超过 2 万亿美元的数字资产面临风险——几乎是整个加密市场的全部价值</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/quantum-computing-migration-2-trillion-digital-assets-risk-crypto-market-bitcoin/</link><description>Quantus 首席执行官 Christoper Smith 表示，数字资产由椭圆曲线加密技术保护，而椭圆曲线加密技术容易受到量子计算的影响。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2278602022-e1786742155382.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 10:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/quantum-computing-migration-2-trillion-digital-assets-risk-crypto-market-bitcoin/</guid></item><item><title>麦肯锡高级合伙人：美国的增长战略需要健康重置</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/mckinsey-senior-partners-americas-growth-strategy-demands-a-health-reset/</link><description>我们的支出与我们的健康状况之间的差距应该引起所有关心国家未来的人的关注。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2286512455-e1786736494786.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/mckinsey-senior-partners-americas-growth-strategy-demands-a-health-reset/</guid></item><item><title>人工智能并没有改变公司的运作方式。它正在改变公司的本质</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/stephen-messer-artificial-commonsense-ai-changing-company/</link><description>赢得人工智能时代的公司将是那些愿意消除为智能稀缺和行动缓慢的世界而建立的假设的公司。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/AWRZaZwY6s0qsQTQ8FUcAYU5k.webp?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/stephen-messer-artificial-commonsense-ai-changing-company/</guid></item><item><title>一些赌徒在 eBay 上购买输掉的彩票，作为抵消赌博胜利税款的一种方式</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/gamblers-winning-taxes-offset-deduction-ebay-writeoff-lottery/</link><description>如果您想抵消赌博收入的税款，在 eBay 上购买价值数千美元的输掉的彩票可能会很有利可图。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2248882887-e1786732821623.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 09:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/gamblers-winning-taxes-offset-deduction-ebay-writeoff-lottery/</guid></item><item><title>“你对葡萄酒的看法总是正确的”：在美国销售的俄勒冈州葡萄酒中，每 4 瓶中就有 1 瓶是背后的女人。</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/amy-prosenjak-oregon-wine/</link><description>艾米·普罗森贾克 (Amy Prosenjak) 花了 20 年时间扩大俄勒冈州最大的葡萄酒业务。现在她的产量减少了，并开始追随消费者。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/ATZ-ERA-RH-june26-courter-headshot-023-e1786737761781.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Sat, 15 Aug 2026 08:30:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/15/amy-prosenjak-oregon-wine/</guid></item><item><title>伊朗称霍尔木兹海峡已被关闭。特朗普政府称每天仍有 900 万桶石油流出</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/iran-strait-of-hormuz-shut-down-trump-9-million-barrels-day/</link><description>“大量非伊朗原油仍在流出，而伊朗原油则不然。” &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2289371588-e1786718875458.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 16:54:27 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/iran-strait-of-hormuz-shut-down-trump-9-million-barrels-day/</guid></item><item><title>Anthropic 需要带来亚马逊式的盈利来证明其 2 万亿美元的估值是合理的，但它几乎没有盈利</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/anthropic-valuation-ipo-amazon-trillion-openai/</link><description>投资者希望 10 月份上市时能筹集 2 万亿美元的资金，并能实现尚未公布年度利润的公司所见过的最快的收入增长之一。这对于 OpenAI 来说可能是个好兆头。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2256654494-e1786666405176.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 07:02:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/anthropic-valuation-ipo-amazon-trillion-openai/</guid></item><item><title>“如果你的关税是 0%，就没有必要进行欺诈”：白宫正在大肆宣扬一项 1120 亿美元的关税规避计划，这让情况变得更糟</title><link>https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/white-house-tariff-dodgers-112-billion-dollar-problem-trump-made-worse/</link><description>特朗普政府正在打击有逃税记录的外国进口商——中国就是其中的中心。 &lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://fortune.com/img-assets/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/GettyImages-2271127364-e1786735050287.jpg?w=2048" alt="图像" /&gt;</description><pubDate>Fri, 14 Aug 2026 19:33:21 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://fortune.com/2026/08/14/white-house-tariff-dodgers-112-billion-dollar-problem-trump-made-worse/</guid></item></channel></